      "content": "The feeling of losing your anchor and losing your sense of self is a profound and devastating experience. It sounds like your connection with him was so fundamental that losing him has upended your entire reality. Please remember that even when the color drains away, you still possess an intrinsic worth that existed before and remains after him. Even in this grayness, tiny sparks of your own identity are still present, and they are worth finding again.",
      "source": "target",
